      "writtenOn": "2024-01-06T00:12:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t see the same tracking of references here as in the C version. The c version separates the (driver) internal and local (owning process) references. I don\u0027t see where this version handles all the edge cases that the C version handles without the same state information.",
      "revId": "c0bf3401d8ad68c748aa0c67ef2ed634bafbfd7e",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
