      "writtenOn": "2024-01-09T01:03:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can you explain the locking scheme used here? It looks like you have eliminated the node lock that the C version used and instead use the inner lock of the process that `owner` points to.",
      "revId": "c0bf3401d8ad68c748aa0c67ef2ed634bafbfd7e",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
