      "writtenOn": "2024-01-17T02:26:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t know either, but all the added allocations in the rust driver compared to the C version has me concerned. Are you running the same tests that @tkjos@google.com used to evaluate the original changes that removed the global binder mutex that the devices used to use. Also, are you measuring the memory footprint of the rust version vs the C version?",
      "parentUuid": "a9ba62c6_830e23bc",
      "range": {
