      "writtenOn": "2024-01-17T11:45:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, I\u0027ve already run those tests and I got similar performance on them. I haven\u0027t measured the memory footprint yet, but it is on my todo list.",
      "parentUuid": "b0063cce_aae5015f",
      "range": {
