      "writtenOn": "2024-01-03T02:16:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why are these two separate extra allocations? We always need to insert the NodeRef (or a way to get to the NodeRef) into both trees and the C version does this without any extra allocation. For the linked list the rust version also seems to avoid allocating extra objects. Could we use a similar solution for the rbtrees?",
      "revId": "c0bf3401d8ad68c748aa0c67ef2ed634bafbfd7e",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
