        "id": 1892347
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-01-26T13:46:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It seems like there is another consequence here. Currently, the nodes don\u0027t keep a list of the processes that have a reference to it, but we need such a list to replicate the data provided by binder_logs. Adding it here would introduce a third allocation, because you can no longer store the binder_ref inside one of the RBTree nodes.",
